  triage:title "Guard regex is missing the peer_delivery_observability module-name symbol (corrected/narrowed)" ;
  triage:description "ruthless-boundary-qa's original RBQA-F001 claimed 3 guard-regex symbol gaps in scripts/phase-am/check_legacy_transport_removal.py; quality-mgr independently tested each claimed gap against the actual regexes and found 2 of the 3 were false alarms (already matched via existing pattern alternation). Only 1 real gap confirmed: the resend-replay category's regex does not match the bare module name 'peer_delivery_observability' (only PeerDrainCoordinator/PeerDeliveryCoordinator symbol names are matched). This is the corrected, narrower version of RBQA-F001 -- supersedes the original 3-item claim." ;
